#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SD2275 expect=violation domain=TS
#note "No TSPARMCD=OBJSEC record anywhere in TS -> the 'Trial Secondary Objective' parameter is missing, one dataset-level finding. The near-miss parameter(s) OBJPRIM are present so a partial/prefix match on the filter would wrongly silence the rule."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#expectViolationCount 1
dataset TS label="Trial Summary"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col TSSEQ    type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col TSPARMCD type=Char label="Trial Summary Parameter Short Name"
col TSPARM   type=Char label="Trial Summary Parameter"
col TSVAL    type=Char label="Parameter Value"
---
S01 | TS | 1 | OBJPRIM | Trial Primary Objective | Assess efficacy of Drug X
S01 | TS | 2 | TITLE | Trial Title | A Study of Drug X in Condition Y
S01 | TS | 3 | TPHASE | Trial Phase Classification | PHASE III TRIAL
